ttp://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202405/t20240520_2026804.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市常态化国民体质监测工作方案\n　　（幼儿、成年人、老年人部分）\n　　根据《中华人民共和国体育法》《关于构建更高水平的全民健身公共服务体系的意见》《福建省全民健身计划（2021-2025 年）》以及国家体育", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202405/t20240520_2026804.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 16:06:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局关于印发《三明市2024年常态化国民体质监测工作方案》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2201953, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202405/t20240520_2026804.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202405/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2016516, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/t20240410_2016516.htm", "content": "\n　　根据《福建省全民健身领导小组办公室关于印发全民健身工程项目实施方案的通知》（闽全民健身办〔2024〕1号）精神，举办全民健身运动会——运动健身进万家系列活动继续列入省委、省政府2024年为民办实事项目，要", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/t20240410_2016516.htm", "docreltime": "2024.02.09 08:46:00", "doctitle": "2024年福建省全民健身运动会三明市实施方案", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2189876, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/t20240410_2016516.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "02", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件一.doc", "appdocid": 2016516, "appfile": "P020240410332816176840.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/t20240410_2016516.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202404/P020240410/P020240410332816176840.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/P020240410332816176840.doc"}, {"appdesc": "附件二.doc", "appdocid": 2016516, "appfile": "P020240410332816298386.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/t20240410_2016516.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202404/P020240410/P020240410332816298386.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/P020240410332816298386.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1985583, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202312/t20231218_1985583.htm", "content": "\n　　一、指导思想\n　　以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，践行习近平总书记关于健康中国的重要指示批示精神，贯彻落实中央、省市相关政策精神，结合三明实际，持续探索“运动促进健康”新模式，深入推进体", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202312/t20231218_1985583.htm", "docreltime": "2023.11.17 18:05:00", "doctitle": "三明市2023-2024年度体卫融合试点建设工作方案", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2152533, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202312/t20231218_1985583.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202312/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1941972, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/t20230911_1941972.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）文体和旅游局：\n　　为进一步激发市场活力，推动体育消费加快回暖回补，促进我市体育消费、畅通体育产业循环，我市拟于7月初起开展“沪明携手 共创未来”——三明市第二届体育消费季暨沪明体育美", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/t20230911_1941972.htm", "docreltime": "2023.06.15 17:42:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局关于做好“你运动 我补贴”体育消费券发放活动的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2101732, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/t20230911_1941972.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件一.docx", "appdocid": 1941972, "appfile": "P020230911644474260229.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/t20230911_1941972.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202309/P020230911/P020230911644474260229.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/P020230911644474260229.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件二.docx", "appdocid": 1941972, "appfile": "P020230911644474363229.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/t20230911_1941972.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202309/P020230911/P020230911644474363229.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/P020230911644474363229.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件三.docx", "appdocid": 1941972, "appfile": "P020230911644474454307.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 3, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/t20230911_1941972.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202309/P020230911/P020230911644474454307.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/P020230911644474454307.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1890913, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890913.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）文体和旅游局、教育局，市直属学校：\n　　现将《2023年三明市少年儿童体育竞赛计划》印发给你们，请遵照执行。\n　　三明市体育局  三明市教育局\n　　2023年3月6日\n　　2023年三明市少年儿童体育竞", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890913.htm", "docreltime": "2023.03.10 09:37:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局 三明市教育局 关于印发2023年三明市少年儿童体育竞赛计划的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2038505, "sourcename": "三明市体育局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890913.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1890910, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890910.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位，各直属机构，各院校：\n　　经市政府研究同意，为激励我市运动员刻苦训练，提高竞技水平，在国内外重大体育比赛中顽强拼搏，创造优异成绩，为三明争光，现对《三明市运动员", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890910.htm", "docreltime": "2023.02.28 09:32:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局  三明市财政局  三明市人力资源和社会保障局关于修订三明市运动员在重大体育比赛中取得优异成绩的奖励办法的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2038501, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890910.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件：三明市运动员在重大体育比赛中取得优异成绩的奖励办法.docx", "appdocid": 1890910, "appfile": "P020230328346727666787.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890910.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202303/P020230328/P020230328346727666787.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/P020230328346727666787.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1890903, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890903.htm", "content": "\n　　一、指导思想\n　　根据省、市2023年为民办实事工作通知精神，推进全市全民健身场地设施建设提升工程，建设更多体育公园、社区“运动角”，以满足群众日益增长的健身需求，不断完善“15分钟健身圈”，让群众有更", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890903.htm", "docreltime": "2023.02.20 09:29:00", "doctitle": "2023年三明市全民健身场地设施建设项目实施方案", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2038494, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/t20230328_1890903.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202303/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1831154, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202209/t20220923_1831154.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）人民政府，市直有关单位，各高等院校：\n　　经市政府同意，现将《三明市深化体教融合促进青少年健康发展实施方案》印发给你们，请结合实际认真贯彻执行。\n　　三明市体育局   三明市教育局\n　　2", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202209/t20220923_1831154.htm", "docreltime": "2022.09.23 09:13:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局 三明市教育局关于印发三明市深化体教融合促进青少年健康发展实施方案的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1962928, "sourcename": "三明市体育局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202209/t20220923_1831154.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202209/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1778200, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202204/t20220419_1778200.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步提升我市竞技体育水平，着力解决竞技体育工作发展不平衡、不充分的问题，稳步推进竞技体育品牌项目建设，现提出如下工作方案。\n　　一、总体目标\n　　通过竞技体育品牌项目建设，完善举重、田径、游泳项", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202204/t20220419_1778200.htm", "docreltime": "2022.04.12 09:56:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局关于下发2022年三明市竞技体育品牌项目建设工作方案的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1901317, "sourcename": "三明市体育局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202204/t20220419_1778200.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202204/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1729798, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/t20211123_1729798.htm", "content": "\n　　为全面实施全民健身国家战略，进一步转变政府职能，落实政府购买服务有关政策，进一步加强疫情防控常态化下的体育社会组织建设，激发活力，促进健康有序发展，充分发挥体育社会组织服务国家、服务社会、服务群众", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/t20211123_1729798.htm", "docreltime": "2021.10.22 10:52:00", "doctitle": "三明市市级体育社团开展全民健身活动经费补助办法", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1843939, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/t20211123_1729798.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1744249, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/t20211230_1744249.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）文体和旅游局:\n　　为加强我市公共游泳场所管理，保障群众游泳安全，根据《福建省体育局关于开展2021年公共游泳场所“双随机、一公开”检查工作的通知》（闽体〔2021〕103号）文件要求，经研究，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/t20211230_1744249.htm", "docreltime": "2021.05.21 18:41:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局关于开展2021年公共游泳场所“双随机、一公开”检查工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1861752, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/t20211230_1744249.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1744248, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/t20211230_1744248.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）文体和旅游局，市社会体育指导员协会：\n　　根据《福建省体育局关于印发2021年全省群众体育工作要点的通知》要求，省体育局将支持我市开展社会体育指导员队伍建设试点工作。为更好的推动试点工作", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/t20211230_1744248.htm", "docreltime": "2021.05.10 18:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市体育局关于印发《三明市社会体育指导员队伍建设试点工作方案》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1861751, "sourcename": "三明市体育局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/t20211230_1744248.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1729792, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共体育政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/t20211123_1729792.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步加强社会体育指导员队伍建设，规范社会体育指导员管理，更好地发挥他们在构建全民健身服务体系、革命老区振兴发展、落实“五抓五做”、创建“模范机关”的积极作用。根据《福建省体育局关于印发2021年全", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/t20211123_1729792.htm", "docreltime": "2021.05.10 10:45:00", "doctitle": "三明市社会体育指导员队伍建设试点工作方案", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1843933, "sourcename": "三明市体育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/t20211123_1729792.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggtyzc/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1744247, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "